      (↓V)←9 9
VALENCE ERROR+
      (↓V)←9 9
       ^
      )SIC
      )CHECK
OK      - no stale functions
OK      - no stale values
OK      - no stale indices
OK      - no duplicate parents

      A←1 ⋄ B←2
      (A∊B)←1 2
SYNTAX ERROR
      (AϵB)←1 2
       ^    ^
      )SIC
      )CHECK
OK      - no stale functions
OK      - no stale values
OK      - no stale indices
OK      - no duplicate parents

      A←1 ⋄ B←2
      (A B[1])←1 2
RANK ERROR+
      (A B[1])←1 2
         ^^
      )SIC
      )CHECK
OK      - no stale functions
OK      - no stale values
OK      - no stale indices
OK      - no duplicate parents

      )ERASE V A B

      )CHECK
