DUMPED ³



      S.a (⎕NC 'X')            ⍝ )PCOPY did not overwrite S
99 2



      )ERASE S X



      S←5



      )COPY /tmp/ZZ71_Bugs32_8.apl S
DUMPED ³



      S.a S.b (⎕NC 'X')        ⍝ S replaced as a whole, only S copied
1 2 0



